### NHANES raw XPORT (large/binary; download locally) ###
data/raw/nhanes_pfas/*.XPT
data/raw/nhanes_pfas/*.xpt

### EPA ECHO ICIS-NPDES bulk downloads (ZIP/CSV; download locally) ###
data/raw/epa_icis_npdes/

### NHANES processed outputs (local, potentially large) ###
data/processed/

### UCMR exceedance training table (large; regenerate via scripts/build_ucmr_exceedance_dataset.py) ###
data/training/ucmr_exceedance_labeled.csv
data/training/*.parquet
data/training/model_matrix_*.csv
data/training/pfas_multisource_training.csv

### EPA UCMR bulk occurrence (download locally; often 100MB–300MB+ per file) ###
data/external/epa_ucmr5/**/*.txt
data/external/epa_ucmr5/**/*.TXT
!data/external/epa_ucmr5/.gitkeep
UCMR5_*.txt
UCMR5_*.csv
**/UCMR5_All*.txt

### QC / upload extracts (can be huge) ###
data/external/qc_datasets/

### External uploads (normalized tables can be large) ###
data/external/external_uploads/*.csv

### Processed training masters (regenerate locally) ###
data/processed/pfas_training_master.csv

